  Memo Site Notes
    // This C&E has the adjacent common areas (but not flats) evacuation after 2.5 minutes, then sitewide 5 minutes
    // Sitewide evacuation is also triggered whenever more than 1 device is triggered
    // The Network Driver device is not programmed into the system devices because the version of HiNet at Radcliffe does not support the Fault Output properly and will always report Fault
    //  
